WEBVTT

00:01.293 --> 00:03.591
Every Discord server has a kitchen.

00:03.793 --> 00:06.157
The channel where everyone ends up.

00:06.613 --> 00:07.941
This is Dzbanek.

00:08.116 --> 00:09.550
It keeps the kitchen going.

00:10.956 --> 00:14.065
Type /play, and whatever you're in the mood for.

00:14.228 --> 00:19.145
A YouTube link, a Spotify playlist, or just the name of a song.

00:19.901 --> 00:21.242
Rather have the radio on?

00:21.431 --> 00:29.992
Seven live stations: Kiss, Rock Radio, Frekvence 1, Heart, Capital, Radio Paradise, and Radio Beat.

00:30.181 --> 00:32.864
Live, with the song that's playing right now.

00:33.670 --> 00:37.391
The Kitchen Board is one message that keeps itself up to date.

00:37.567 --> 00:41.274
What's playing, who's in voice, and today's best deal.

00:42.017 --> 00:46.443
Every morning at 3:33, ten Steam deals worth a look.

00:46.631 --> 00:49.528
And Epic's free games, as soon as they drop.

00:50.334 --> 00:52.021
And when somebody new walks in?

00:52.196 --> 00:53.124
They get a cookie.

00:54.130 --> 00:54.912
Dzbanek.

00:55.101 --> 00:55.936
It's free.

00:56.112 --> 00:57.053
Pull up a chair.
